    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">torcŭlus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		torcular, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a
			press</i>, = torcularius. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vasa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 1, 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">11, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">14, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">funis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 14, 68</span></i>
			; 135, 3.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">torcŭ-lum</span></b> , i, n., =
			torcular, I., <i>a press</i>, <i><span class="en">Varr.
				R. R. 1, 55, 7</span></i>; id. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 47,
				23</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 18, 31, 74, § 317</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				Ep. 9, 20, 2</span></i>.</div>
